{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "0431d818ef46ef5c0d98e86dd40c82a45edd3d0c5d5891d395cd8be322bde681", "ja": "育は、オーディションモードで勝つの、\n上手だったね。", "zh": "育在试镜模式里很擅长获胜呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
