{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "86617ee580ec653cfc43d54e22426ae970e6d721142037c9177db75fcb9180e9", "ja": "む……。別にいいけど。\n桃子だって、もっと上手になるし。", "zh": "唔……反正无所谓。\n桃子也会玩得更厉害的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "75d253bfd0dc1d30b69beed50f4afed016cb6ca7828735a97d56f33c7145089f", "ja": "たまきも！　たまきもがんばる！", "zh": "环也！环也也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "edb314e02cb93561666af115f462e9fd636bac0041a50d6f8435148d66c3fe43", "ja": "でも……わたし、ちゃんとお仕事できてたかなあ？", "zh": "可是……我有没有好好完成工作呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "45505b636a45c591f3e8eeeb6d05e2f12553af50d78c63148a8c045421b1f17c", "ja": "自分ばっかり、楽しんでなかったかなって。\nなんか、急に心配になってきちゃった。", "zh": "我在想，会不会只有我自己玩得开心了。突然有点担心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "95501ac506b34d85233898bdafc321fb7b2aba2b6dce02eeac8285a6a08e364a", "ja": "できてたんじゃない？　育がコーデのコツを\n話してる時、みんな、楽しそうに聞いてたし。", "zh": "不是已经做得很好了吗？育在讲搭配诀窍的时候，大家不都听得很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "82f13af92fa0ff38e1fa2327d653c241817289b46ec62a62b292ea795a33c2c0", "ja": "ももこ、たまきは！？　たまき、ゲームのお仕事って\nどうすればいいのっておやぶんに聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "桃子，环呢！？环问过老大，\n游戏的工作该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "736178df2d6761a515a8dba9f3ad1d014d5950fd6560ac7e298122bb74e59b5d", "ja": "ゲームが楽しいってことが、伝わればいいんだよって。\nたまき、ちゃんと伝えられてたと思う？", "zh": "只要能让大家感受到游戏很有趣就好了。环觉得自己有好好传达出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_026_tm_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_026_tm_01_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "64447aebc3bf9a4ec10a6453a671c6eb58ac11f04f69a3b2fbc3278a572e7014", "ja": "うん、伝えられてたと思うよ。みんな、\n環と一緒にゲームして、楽しそうだったでしょ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得传达到了哦。大家\n和环一起玩游戏的时候，看起来都很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
